   {"src": "KLN", "where": "s.vv. globe, glebe", "stance": "supports", "note": "'glebe ... in gradational relationship to globus, \"ball, sphere\" ... fr. I.-E. base *gelebh-, *glebh-, \"to roll up into a ball, compress\"' — Klein even writes the base in the shape Nourai heads the chart with (Geleb)."}
