   {"src": "LAT", "where": "Ernout-Meillet s.v. globus, list of dérivés", "stance": "supports", "note": "'Dérivés: globo,-as ... globulus m.; globōsus ... conglobō' — globulus is a Latin, not a French, coinage."}
